<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes forming part of above Consolidated results   n  n1)tThe above Un-audited financial results were duly reviewed by the Audit Committee at its meeting held on February 05,2020 and were taken on record and approved by the Board of Directors at their meeting held on February 06,2020  along with the Limited Review  Report issued by the Statutory Auditor on Financial Results;  n  n2)tThe Company has acquired majority controlling interest upon acquisition of Equity shares on July 11,2019 in Kaycee Industries Limited (“Subsidiary Company”)  which consequently became Subsidiary to the Company in terms of Provisions of Section 2(87) of the Companies Act 2013.  Accordingly, year to date consolidated financial results represent nine months financials of Salzer Electronics Limited (“Holding Company”) and financials of the subsidiary company from the date of acquisition of its Controlling interest i.e July 11, 2019.  n  n3)tThe given figures are not strictly comparable to any of the relevant corresponding period of the last year in view of reasons stated in para 2 and accordingly figures for respective period of previous years  not furnished.  n  n4)tThe Company, as a Promoter, earlier had held 76.92% equity stake with voting rights in the Subsidiary Company. During the quarter under review, it diluted 2.01% equity stake in the open market and reduced to 74.91% which enabled the subsidiary company complying with norms of minimum public shareholding of not less than 25% in terms of Rule 19(2) and Rule 19A of the Securities Contracts (Regulation) Rules, 1957 and Regulation 38 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) 2015.  n  n5)tThis Statement has been prepared in accordance with the Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules 2015 (IND AS) prescribed under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 and other recognised accounting practices and policies to the extent applicable.  n  nFor SALZER ELECTRONICS LIMITED  n  nN.RANGACHARY  nCHAIRMAN  n(DIN: 00054437)  n  nCoimbatore - 641 047. t  nFebruary 06, 2020</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
